sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant G as Gateway proxy
  participant E as Endpoint Picker
  participant S as Decode sidecar
  participant P as Prefill pod
  participant D as Decode vLLM
  C->>G: 1. Chat request
  G->>E: 2. Which pods?
  E-->>G: 3. Decode pod + prefill pod
  G->>S: 4. Request + prefill address
  S->>P: 5. Same prompt, max_tokens=1
  Note over P: 6. Prefill writes KV cache
  P-->>S: 7. KV transfer params
  S->>D: 8. Request + KV transfer params
  D->>P: 9. Pull KV blocks (NIXL, RDMA)
  Note over P: 10. Free the KV copy
  D-->>C: 11. Stream tokens via sidecar and gateway
